228	    /** Transform an in-plane point into a 3D space point.
229	     * @param point in-plane point (must be a {@link
230	     * org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.twod.Vector2D Vector2D} instance)
231	     * @return 3D space point (really a {@link Vector3D Vector3D} instance)
232	     * @see #toSubSpace
