239	    /** Get one point from the 3D-space.
240	     * @param inPlane desired in-plane coordinates for the point in the
241	     * plane
242	     * @param offset desired offset for the point
243	     * @return one point in the 3D-space, with given coordinates and offset
244	     * relative to the plane
